Important compliance and branding constraints

Robinhood’s current guidelines require the full name “Robinhood Chain,” prohibit presenting a project as affiliated with Robinhood, and restrict using Robinhood marks or $HOOD in third-party token branding.

Stock Tokens are restricted securities in several jurisdictions, including the United States, United Kingdom and Canada. A permissionless deployment does not eliminate front-end, marketing or access-control obligations.

Because you are operating from South Africa, obtain South African and target-market counsel before offering paid prizes, yield, revenue rights or anything marketed as an investment return.

Final recommendation: keep Zentory on HyperEVM, build GapSafe’s public dashboard immediately, validate the hook over two market weekends, and launch a token only once it has an indispensable role in the working protocol. That gives you a simple narrative, a real technical moat and credible non-rug positioning.

